## Context

Ticket 0534 batched the 13 prose-review-panel minors; PR #968 implemented
them. The author's reading-1 annotations (2026-06-11, main+hdm.pdf) later
appended nine more items (14-22) to 0534's body, after #968 was already
executed. The port PR (supersedes #967/#968, lands the ratified content
on `slides/manuscript/main.tex`) closes 0534 with only the original 13
dispositions; this ticket carries the unimplemented additions so they
are not lost in the close.

## Relevant files

- `slides/manuscript/main.tex` — the manuscript (LaTeX since ticket 0524;
  page anchors below refer to the author's annotated PDF of the main.md
  build — re-locate by quoted text)
- `tests/test_manuscript_cohort_and_caveats.py` — abstract register guard
  (no em-dash in abstract already enforced; item 14 extends the restyle
  to the body)

## Actions (verbatim from the author annotation brief)

14. Em-dashes are an AI tell — sweep and restyle (abstract and body).
    (Abstract is already em-dash-free per 0532 round 2; the body sweep
    overlaps ticket 0541's register harmonisation — coordinate.)
15. Runs of three -ly adverbs and six-in-a-row trisyllabic words
    (abstract) — plain bad writing, simplify.
16. p2: "restrictive licences" is irrelevant to the GIGO argument — cut.
17. p2: reduce F1 prominence in the intro ("less on F1").
18. p3: define precision and recall at first use.
19. p4: clarify the Wikipedia snapshot date.
20. p4: "scaffolding" sentence is out.
21. p6: LLM-tell prose flagged near quality-bar section — rewrite plainly.
22. p6 (Figure 2 intro): remove AI contrast-framing ("not X but Y"), the
    what-it-is-not enumeration, and the unjustified opening claim that
    capability improves statistical quality — go straight to the point.

## Invariants

- House crossref rules (tests/test_manuscript_crossref.py) stay green.
- The 0532 round-2 ratified abstract/conclusion text is not reworded
  beyond what an item above explicitly directs.

## Exit criteria

- [x] Each item fixed or explicitly waived with a one-line reason in the log
- [x] Manuscript builds; `make check` green
